WEBVTT

00:00:05.160 --> 00:00:06.000
SILVER  FANG

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.290
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:00:08.290 --> 00:00:13.300
GINGA NAGAREBOSHI   GIN

00:00:13.300 --> 00:00:13.800
Galactic Shooting Star Silver
SILVER  FANG

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:28.100
Silver, Get away!

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:48.370
Silver!

00:01:56.040 --> 00:02:02.480
<i>Silver is crying for help. He only
dares to challenge the huge bear cause -</i>

00:02:02.630 --> 00:02:05.560
<i>he trusts in Daisuke's help.</i>

00:02:05.700 --> 00:02:11.400
<i>But Daisuke was so afraid
that he forgot to shoot with his bow.</i>

00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.840
Silver!

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.720
Silver...!

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:43.850
Outrage! The bloodstained victory

00:03:11.840 --> 00:03:14.130
<i>Daisuke!</i>

00:03:16.930 --> 00:03:24.180
<i>The bears look huge
when they are angry and attack.</i>

00:03:24.560 --> 00:03:28.640
<i>Don't be afraid of it. Understand?</i>

00:03:29.150 --> 00:03:33.560
<i>The weak spot
is in the centerline.</i>

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:39.190
<i>Aim for the center.
Don't be afraid Daisuke!</i>

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:43.110
Dammit!

00:03:50.160 --> 00:03:53.990
Come here lousy bear!
Attack!

00:04:06.630 --> 00:04:10.000
To the center... to the center!

00:04:56.580 --> 00:05:00.320
The Bow?... Over there!

00:05:10.130 --> 00:05:11.330
Sorry Silver!

00:05:32.320 --> 00:05:34.980
Now Silver! Let go!

00:05:39.780 --> 00:05:41.810
Silver!

00:05:49.160 --> 00:05:51.780
Over here ugly!

00:05:58.580 --> 00:06:02.870
<i>Dammit!
I can't see the center.</i>

00:06:09.170 --> 00:06:14.630
<i>My hands hurt so bad...
Turn this way!</i>

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.150
<i>Good! Just like that you damn bear!</i>

00:06:29.520 --> 00:06:34.060
<i>I can't die before
I have defeated Akakabuto!</i>

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:45.690
<i>Now!</i>

00:06:51.120 --> 00:06:52.990
No!

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:07.290
Saved...!

00:07:12.590 --> 00:07:17.040
<i>Silver did not move
an inch from Daisuke's side.</i>

00:07:17.220 --> 00:07:23.340
<i>He honestly had genuine faith in
Daisuke as a partner.</i>

00:07:23.890 --> 00:07:29.550
<i>The boy and the dog stood united,
like one living being.</i>

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:52.280
Take this!

00:08:33.810 --> 00:08:37.810
Silver... We killed it!

00:09:05.710 --> 00:09:11.750
<i>Mother Nature granted the 12 year old
and the young Silver, their first victory.</i>

00:09:12.090 --> 00:09:16.750
<i>It was May
and stormy weather.</i>

00:09:58.960 --> 00:10:00.700
Silver!

00:10:00.960 --> 00:10:02.600
Silver! Is that a scratch?!

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:06.410
Right. The bear!

00:10:12.260 --> 00:10:16.960
Yes, we made it.
Me and Silver killed the bear!

00:10:25.310 --> 00:10:30.300
Silver, you all right?
You got hurt!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:37.890
I'm sorry. You got hurt
cause I was weak.

00:10:40.030 --> 00:10:46.440
But you were really strong.
You will be even stronger than Riki!

00:10:48.300 --> 00:10:50.560
What's the matter?

00:11:22.050 --> 00:11:29.260
<i>Hidetoshi's group chased
the other bears in Akakabuto's clan.</i>

00:11:35.810 --> 00:11:40.960
<i>John had ran ahead
to win some time.</i>

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:17.320
<i>John knew the bears movement
and what it was going to do.</i>

00:12:17.470 --> 00:12:20.830
<i>He doesn't make any useless attacks.</i>

00:12:40.400 --> 00:12:46.100
<i>John was so fast that
the bear thought there were many dogs.</i>

00:12:47.240 --> 00:12:50.180
<i>It was a good tactic to delay the bear.</i>

00:13:12.710 --> 00:13:14.750
Get back John!

00:13:18.090 --> 00:13:21.000
Now leave it to me.

00:13:34.310 --> 00:13:37.260
He made it!

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.910
Okay, John. We got it!

00:14:18.130 --> 00:14:20.920
Are there others?

00:14:26.720 --> 00:14:28.670
No, Silver!

00:14:32.140 --> 00:14:35.010
Those are Akakabuto's cubs.

00:14:55.620 --> 00:14:59.390
Was it their mother?

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:06.160
Have i done the same Akakabuto did?

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:12.110
Silver... poor little things.

00:15:13.880 --> 00:15:17.790
I'm sorry. I had no other choice!

00:15:17.970 --> 00:15:21.820
It would have killed us!

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.460
John!

00:15:33.350 --> 00:15:38.580
Run! You are in Akakabuto's pack
but you are too small. Go!

00:15:39.650 --> 00:15:42.430
Quickly! Go!

00:15:55.780 --> 00:15:59.160
No, John! They are cubs,
they are innocent!

00:16:00.300 --> 00:16:01.800
No, John!

00:16:04.040 --> 00:16:06.030
No!

00:16:15.420 --> 00:16:17.200
Silver!

00:16:19.840 --> 00:16:24.830
<i>Silver was furious but not
because someone stole his prey.</i>

00:16:24.970 --> 00:16:29.170
<i>John butchered a helpless cub
and was proud of it.</i>

00:16:29.350 --> 00:16:31.800
<i>Silver couldn't stand it.</i>

00:16:33.400 --> 00:16:37.260
<i>John thinks everyone as prey.</i>

00:16:37.390 --> 00:16:41.800
<i>He was an excellent and
obedient dog.</i>

00:16:42.020 --> 00:16:46.720
<i>He did not have any remorse.</i>

00:16:50.490 --> 00:16:54.600
Stop, Silver!
John is our friend!

00:17:40.400 --> 00:17:42.880
Silver! Stop!

00:17:56.870 --> 00:17:58.980
John!

00:17:59.280 --> 00:18:03.570
John, where are you? Where are you?!

00:18:05.500 --> 00:18:12.700
The doctor is coming! He can't know i borrowed the bow!

00:18:14.590 --> 00:18:16.910
John!

00:18:18.010 --> 00:18:20.670
Lets go, Silver!

00:18:29.260 --> 00:18:32.170
Over here!
- There he is!

00:18:35.680 --> 00:18:39.680
What in earth?!
Did John kill it?

00:18:39.810 --> 00:18:43.800
No, these didn't come from a bite.

00:18:44.020 --> 00:18:49.360
Who then?
Only we came to the mountain.

00:18:56.660 --> 00:19:00.150
what...?! Its...

00:19:05.910 --> 00:19:11.370
<i>Daisuke. Did you and Silver
kill that giant?</i>

00:19:18.420 --> 00:19:23.040
<i>Daisuke and Silver
rushed down the mountain.</i>

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:28.710
<i>But countless silhouettes
followed them with their eyes.</i>

00:19:30.260 --> 00:19:34.550
<i>It was an unknown dog pack.</i>

00:19:40.150 --> 00:19:46.310
<i>Mysterious shadows.
Even John didn't notice them.</i>

00:19:53.820 --> 00:19:58.560
Listen! When the doctor comes, just
act normal. Okay?

00:20:12.920 --> 00:20:16.490
Silver,
act normal.

00:20:18.590 --> 00:20:23.040
What, did Daisuke shoot the bear with a bow?

00:20:23.220 --> 00:20:25.880
He has grown.

00:20:26.050 --> 00:20:29.990
I would never have allowed it,
but it's very impressive.

00:20:30.180 --> 00:20:35.050
Don't be a fool Hidetoshi.
Akakabuto is totally different.

00:20:35.220 --> 00:20:40.460
We can't praise him for his victory.
It might cost his life.

00:20:41.730 --> 00:20:43.640
I understand.

00:20:49.070 --> 00:20:50.640
He is coming...

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:51.720
You forgot this.

00:20:53.350 --> 00:20:54.760
Dammit!

00:20:56.280 --> 00:20:59.020
I shouldn't have shown you
how to shoot with the bow.

00:20:59.820 --> 00:21:03.780
You're not allowed to touch the bow now. Never come here again.

00:21:03.820 --> 00:21:05.150
Doctor, please!...

00:21:05.240 --> 00:21:06.900
No excuses! Go!

00:21:07.040 --> 00:21:11.080
Wait! I'm sorry I borrowed
the bow without permission.

00:21:11.080 --> 00:21:15.040
But, I want to kill Akakabuto
for Riki and grandpa!

00:21:16.830 --> 00:21:17.960
Why did you do that?

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:19.700
Arrogant kid!

00:21:19.840 --> 00:21:23.580
You are ten years too young to go against Akakabuto.

00:21:23.760 --> 00:21:26.040
Get out of here!

00:21:29.600 --> 00:21:30.350
Goddammit!

00:21:30.680 --> 00:21:33.810
Who is arrogant!?
I hate you!

00:21:46.610 --> 00:21:48.910
Nobody understands us.

00:21:49.860 --> 00:21:55.370
We won't trust anyone no more.
We will meet Akakabuto just the two of us.

00:22:13.250 --> 00:22:19.830
<i>As a reward for the first victory
Silver got three scars.</i>

00:22:22.920 --> 00:22:28.790
<i>Like a symbol of the three
bear-dog-generation.</i>

00:22:43.850 --> 00:22:48.300
<i>Silver thought it was
a males honor award.</i>
